WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Look how much you have destroyed my neighborhood.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,130
What if my owners complain?

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:08,130
Then how can I have enough money in the future?

4
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:09,130
Let’s talk about compensation.

5
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:12,130
If the compensation you offer can satisfy me

6
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:14,220
I can consider letting you go

7
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:17,180
This Baoan is so powerful

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,470
I'm afraid to look at the whole world

9
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:21,470
There are not many jade ghosts either

10
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:23,470
can be compared with him

11
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:26,540
What can our Ghost Suppression Bureau come up with?

12
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:33,880
Let him let us go

13
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,880
We are willing to use this top ghost weapon from our Ghost Suppression Bureau

14
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,880
Xuesha Zhetian Powder will compensate you

15
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:38,880
Okay, okay

16
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:41,010
You sunshades are scattered and the stars are red.

17
00:00:41,010 --> 00:00:42,010
A smell of blood

18
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:43,010
Who would want it?

19
00:00:43,010 --> 00:00:45,520
How much is it worth?

20
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:49,870
This little thing is just a dream to cover the losses of our community.
